<title>POLAND: STOMIL SANOK 96 NET RISES TO PLN 15.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>STOMIL SANOK 96 NET RISES TO PLN 15.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.31 vs   0.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.31 vs   0.32</p>
<p> Operating loss	 1.06 vs   0.02</p>
<p> Sales		    9.83 vs   8.64</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    15.13 vs   8.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	15.30 vs   8.23</p>
<p> Operating profit    13.50 vs   9.30</p>
<p> Sales		  138.53 vs 114.22</p>
<p>Note. Operating loss results from the creation of provisions</p>
<p>for liabilities, inventories etc. Full name of the Polish</p>
<p>tyremaker is Stomil Sanok SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
